    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνηστ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forgetfulness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶναι ἐν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Mx.</u>
					239e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				19.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.612d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp.
				<i>amnesty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν προγεγενημένων ἐγκλημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					633.36
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				<u>Vit.Caes.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>failure to mention</i> thing, <i>passing</i> it <i>over</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.371H.
			</span></i></div>
